## Storage Architecture After Completion

```
DRIVE-SYNCED (Google Drive backup)
D:\My Drive\Sync\omniroute_backup/        (to be deleted after Phase 1 verification)
D:\My Drive\Sync\Config\omniroute/
├── storage.sqlite                 (ORIGINAL - synced)
├── oauth/                         (ORIGINAL - synced)
├── .env                           (ORIGINAL - synced)
├── db_backups/                    (ORIGINAL - synced)
├── omniroute_config_*.py          (ORIGINAL - synced)
├── call_logs/ → ⛓️ LOCAL JUNCTION
├── logs/ → ⛓️ LOCAL JUNCTION
├── qoder-cli/ → ⛓️ LOCAL JUNCTION
├── server/ → ⛓️ LOCAL JUNCTION
└── supervisor/ → ⛓️ LOCAL JUNCTION

LOCAL MASTER (D: drive - sovereign)
D:\My System\Local App Junction\OmniRoute/
├── [entire app code, node_modules, dist, src, etc.]
└── Config/
    ├── call_logs/
    ├── logs/
    ├── qoder-cli/
    ├── server/
    └── supervisor/

C: DRIVE JUNCTIONS (user/developer access)
C:\Users\[User]\... → D:\My System\Local App Junction\OmniRoute
C:\Users\[User]\... → D:\My Drive\Sync\Config\omniroute [works through Drive's junctions]
```

